## 12. Success Criteria

### Functional Requirements
- ✅ YAML schema is human-readable and comprehensible
- ✅ Transpiler converts valid YAML to compilable Rust code
- ✅ Generated code uses AutoAgents SDK
- ✅ All 13+ tools are implemented
