### Performance Requirements
- ✅ 500-line YAML transpiles in <2 seconds (incremental)
- ✅ 5,000-line YAML transpiles in <5 seconds (incremental)
- ✅ Vulkan acceleration provides 5-10x speedup over CPU
- ✅ LM Studio integration adds <20ms HTTP overhead

### Quality Requirements
- ✅ Generated code is LLM-maintainable (GLM 4.7)
- ✅ No unsafe code (except via llama-cpp-2)
- ✅ Proper error handling (no unwrap in production)
- ✅ Type-safe throughout
- ✅ Well-documented (doc comments on all public items)

