## 13. Constraints and Assumptions

### Constraints
- Must use selected tech stack (serde-saphyr, Askama, AutoAgents, tokio)
- Must support Vulkan, CUDA, Metal backends
- Must generate code that GLM 4.7 can maintain
- Must be fast (transpilation + compilation)
- Must not require cloud dependencies

### Assumptions
- User has LM Studio or llama.cpp installed
- User has GPU with appropriate drivers (Vulkan, CUDA, Metal)
- User has modern hardware (8+ cores, 16GB+ RAM)
- YAML files follow the specified schema
- Generated code runs on Linux, macOS, Windows

